        {"@value": "Due date by which a corrective action must be completed.", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:contentHash",
      "@type": "owl:DatatypeProperty",
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "xsd:string"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "내용 해시", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "content hash", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "SHA-256 해시. PROV-O 출처 추적 보강 — 동일 콘텐츠 멱등 식별. 형식: 'sha256:...'", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "SHA-256 hash. Reinforces PROV-O provenance tracking — idempotent content identification. Format: 'sha256:...'", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:Action",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "rdfs:subClassOf": [
        {"@id": "prov:Plan"},
        {"@id": "iao:IAO_0000030"}
      ],
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "안전 액션 (실행 가능 행동)", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Safety Action (Executable Capability)", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "한국 안전관리자가 LLM에게 위임할 수 있는 실행 가능 행동. 작업계획서 생성·점검 기록·사고 보고 등. 선언적 액션 패턴 — Parameters + Submission Criteria + Side Effects + Trace 로 의도·검증·부수효과·이력을 명시. PROV-O Plan 의 sub-class (의도된 행동 절차).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Executable capability that a Korean safety manager can delegate to an LLM. E.g., generate work plan, record inspection, report accident. Declarative action pattern — Parameters + Submission Criteria + Side Effects + Trace explicitly define intent, validation, side effects, and provenance. Sub-class of PROV-O Plan (intended action procedure).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:hasParameter",
      "@type": "owl:DatatypeProperty",
      "rdfs:domain": {"@id": "safety:Action"},
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "xsd:string"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "파라미터 (JSON Schema)", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "parameter (JSON Schema)", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "Action 호출 시 LLM이 채워야 할 파라미터 정의 (JSON Schema 형식 stringify).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Parameter definition that an LLM must fill when invoking the Action (JSON Schema, stringified).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:submissionCriterion",
      "@type": "owl:DatatypeProperty",
      "rdfs:domain": {"@id": "safety:Action"},
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "xsd:string"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "제출 조건 (검증 규칙)", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "submission criterion (validation rule)", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "Action 실행 전 자동 검증되는 비즈니스 규칙 (예: depth >= 2m → 산안기준규칙 §38 의무).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Business rule auto-validated before Action execution (e.g., depth >= 2m → Standard Regulation §38 mandatory).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:sideEffect",
      "@type": "owl:DatatypeProperty",
      "rdfs:domain": {"@id": "safety:Action"},
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "xsd:string"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "부수 효과", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "side effect", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "Action 실행 시 발생하는 부수 효과 (markdown 반환·draft 저장·결재 알림 등).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Side effects upon Action execution (return markdown, save draft, send approval notification, etc.).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:appliesTo",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "safety:WorkActivity"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "적용 대상 작업", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "applies to work activity", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "도메인은 union(Action, StandardDocument, SafetyChecklist) — Action·기준문서·점검표 모두 작업에 적용 가능 (a-codex 11차 review 정정: domain 제거하고 SHACL 별 검증).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Domain is union(Action, StandardDocument, SafetyChecklist) — actions, standard documents, and checklists all apply to work activities. Domain removed; SHACL validates per case (a-codex 11th review correction).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    },

    {
      "@id": "safety:hasRisk",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "owl:equivalentProperty": {"@id": "safety:hasHazard"},
      "rdfs:domain": {"@id": "safety:WorkActivity"},
      "rdfs:range": {"@id": "safety:Hazard"},
      "rdfs:label": [
        {"@value": "위험을 가짐 (alias)", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "has risk (alias)", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": [
        {"@value": "IDENTITY §5 14 관계 #3 'Task hasRisk SafetyRisk' 의 alias. 실 IRI 는 safety:hasHazard 이며 SafetyRisk ≅ safety:Hazard. owl:equivalentProperty 로 정합 (a-codex 11차 review 정정).", "@language": "ko"},
        {"@value": "Alias for IDENTITY §5 relation #3 'Task hasRisk SafetyRisk'. Actual IRI is safety:hasHazard; SafetyRisk ≅ safety:Hazard. Defined via owl:equivalentProperty (a-codex 11th review correction).", "@language": "en"}
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {"@id": "https://safety.ratelworks.org/skeleton/v1"}
    }
  ]
}
